  "segments": [
    {
      "s": 0.0,
      "e": 5.02,
      "text": "These three students in Sweden almost got banned from their university for creating an AI learning system."
    },
    {
      "s": 5.2,
      "e": 12.66,
      "text": "The first month we launched, we reached 130,000 euro ARR. It was like pure word of mouth growth."
    },
    {
      "s": 12.9,
      "e": 17.52,
      "text": "They actually called us in and wanted us to to stop what we were doing."
    },
    {
      "s": 17.8,
      "e": 21.48,
      "text": "This is Isabel Andreas and Eric and in the last six months they dropped out of college,"
    },
    {
      "s": 21.7,
      "e": 25.0,
      "text": "moved into a 25 square meter apartment and snuck into a Google event,"
    },
    {
      "s": 25.12,
      "e": 27.5,
      "text": "all on a mission to reinvent how people learn."
    },
    {
      "s": 27.5,
      "e": 32.26,
      "text": "Is the best way to learn stuff by reading a book or going to lectures and such?"
    },
    {
      "s": 32.54,
      "e": 33.66,
      "text": "I don't think so, personally."
    },
    {
      "s": 33.92,
      "e": 38.3,
      "text": "The year is 1088 and Bologna opens the first university for the smartest people across the"
    },
    {
      "s": 38.3,
      "e": 43.12,
      "text": "world. A thousand years later, the system hasn't changed because while universities cost more than"
    },
    {
      "s": 43.12,
      "e": 46.86,
      "text": "ever, 40% of students will drop out before they finish their degree."
    },
    {
      "s": 47.22,
      "e": 53.7,
      "text": "I have ADHD. I managed school. I did get the good grades but it was very tough."
    },
    {
      "s": 53.7,
      "e": 61.02,
      "text": "Everyone learns differently. It's a system that needs to be personalized and adapt for every human"
    },
    {
      "s": 61.02,
      "e": 62.54,
      "text": "that learns in different ways."
    },
    {
      "s": 62.94,
      "e": 65.26,
      "text": "So instead of forcing students to learn the old-fashioned way,"
    },
    {
      "s": 65.66,
      "e": 68.56,
      "text": "they left their lives behind and bet everything on cloud."
    },
    {
